        "assessment": {
          "concrete_defects": [
            "Agave leaves and dark feet have conspicuously angular silhouettes versus the reference's softer surface treatment.",
            "Small cobalt motifs soften on receding tile surfaces and mobile views; tile/corner joins and terracotta rim blocks look coarse at those scales.",
            "Ceramic and terracotta finishes are relatively matte and simplified, retaining the palette but not all of the illustration's surface variation."
          ],
          "id": "mexico",
          "inspected_paths": [
