            "parent/sources/mexico/marketing.webp"
          ],
          "limitations": [
            "All five original images inspected at normal size against the illustration's theme/material identity, not a hyperrealism standard.",
            "The agave is not exposed from the open underside viewpoint; that does not establish that the ornament is missing or detached.",
            "Static frames cannot establish hidden collisions, intermediate motion, or control operation. No art approval or changes."
          ],
          "observations": "Cobalt floral tiles, warm terracotta lid, blue-green agave and brass hardware remain clearly recognizable and closely aligned with the illustration. Both open views are complete and unobstructed; no obvious major broken texture, missing panel or page overlap.",
